Z||000000||Mach10||06-09-2001||11:44 PM||||I was walking around my car, trying to visualize paint colours, when I got to thinking (uh oh...). I've always been a fan of Symetry. What I'd REALLY like is to have an exact copy of the driver-side air vent on the other side. <BR>Has this ever been done? Anyone have a kit that you know of? If not, then I appeal to the gods of 'glass to help me mastermind such a project. I'd like it to be functional. I can pipe in some nice cool air into the compartment... The internal bits I am ok with, but I have little experience with making my own panels. What would be the best solution?||||reg||5
