Z||000009||Pontiaddict||06-11-2001||01:59 AM||||You can't do that grizco because the side vent is directional, if you cut it off the left side and stick it on the right, it look backwards, if you flip it upside down, it will look upside down.<BR>Lets see if I can do some examples in ascii<BR>stock left: \=! (wheelwell)<BR>stock left cut and pasted on right:<BR>(wheelwell) \=!<BR>stock left flipped upside down on right:<BR>(wheelwell) !=\<BR>If this makes any sense then you should get the point. I can barely figure it out with what I put up there so don't feel bad if you don't get it.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Pontiaddict (edited 06-11-2001).]||||reg||1
